{
  "id": "stmt:nice:ta439:1.1:1",
  "type": "Statement",
  "description": "The U.K. National Institute for Health and Care Excellence (NICE) has recommended cetuximab, within its marketing authorisation, as an option for previously untreated EGFR-expressing, RAS wild-type metastatic colorectal cancer in adults, in combination with FOLFOX or FOLFIRI. Cetuximab is recommended within its marketing authorisation and subject to the commercial access agreement available to the NHS.",
